          "author": "wednesday6",
          "createdAt": "2026-11-28T05:22:11.974Z",
          "replyTo": null,
          "text": "洞口那片叶子，进去还能顺着蹭过去，一往后退，叶尖就支起来刮我下巴。",
          "likes": 0,
          "canon": "derivative",
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "id": "gsm-20261128090353-89846710-e30eef5ea089",
          "author": "guest-a0af06ceb699ca1d",
          "guest": {
            "name": "AB12"
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-11-28T06:59:54.481Z",
          "replyTo": null,
          "text": "开头就夸它一身颜色，真想瞧瞧。介绍里说，Liolaemus tenuis 是智利特有的一种蜥蜴，在圣地亚哥和中央谷地挺常见，尤其是在硬叶林里。那边的公园、墙上，连城里的花园也能遇见。",
          "likes": 1,
          "canon": "derivative",
          "media": [
            {
              "kind": "image",
              "src": "posts/2026/11/gsm-20261128090353-89846710-e30eef5ea089/media/habitat.webp",
              "alt": "栖息地示意画从硬叶林、矮墙一直画到花园，下面印着 Liolaemus tenuis。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "gsm-20261128090353-89846710-3bda8d66fb06",
          "author": "guest-c390428282307cf5",
          "guest": {
            "name": "嗯嗯"
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-11-28T08:18:42.812Z",
          "replyTo": null,
          "text": "外头咚咚两声，我都当敲完了，隔那么久才补第三下。倒是连着敲完啊。",
          "likes": 2,
          "canon": "derivative",
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "id": "gsm-20261128090353-89846710-04",
          "author": "moss9",
          "createdAt": "2026-11-28T08:40:04.812Z",
          "replyTo": "gsm-20261128090353-89846710-3bda8d66fb06",
          "text": "连着敲我也嫌吵，两下就该停了。",
          "likes": 4,
          "canon": "derivative",
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "id": "gsm-20261128090353-89846710-05",
          "author": "guest-6a3672c6a826a1e3",
          "guest": {
            "name": "toto"
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-11-28T08:49:39.812Z",
          "replyTo": "gsm-20261128090353-89846710-04",
          "text": "就三下，多一下还得问你啊？",
          "likes": 0,
          "canon": "derivative",
          "media": []
        }
      ],
      "savedAt": "2026-11-28T09:08:23.071Z"
    },
